This repository contains framework-integration packages (pydantic-ai,
LangChain, LiteLLM, and TypeScript/JS tool-calling helpers) that wrap
Algenta's published client SDKs. It does not contain, vendor, or depend on
the Algenta Engine or its runtime, which are separately distributed and
subject to the Algenta Engine license, not Apache-2.0. Every package in
this repository depends only on the published `algenta-sdk` package (PyPI
and npm) and talks to a customer's own self-hosted Algenta Engine over
HTTP/MCP at runtime — never a bundled or local engine. See
scripts/check-no-engine-dependency.py, which is run in CI on every pull
request to enforce this boundary mechanically, not just by policy.
